# Where the backend API lives. Leave UNSET for local dev (Vite proxies /api to
# localhost:8090) and for single-server deploys (backend serves this build).
#
# Set it only when the frontend is hosted separately (e.g. Vercel) and must
# reach a backend on another origin. No trailing slash. The app appends "/api".
#
# VITE_API_BASE=https://tracker-api.up.railway.app
